sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Frontend
    participant AdminAPI as admin-service
    participant SupabaseDB as Supabase DB
    participant SupabaseStorage as Supabase Storage

    Admin->>Frontend: Ouvrir liste des documents
    Frontend->>AdminAPI: Demander la liste admin
    AdminAPI->>SupabaseDB: Lire metadonnees + uploader
    AdminAPI->>SupabaseStorage: Recuperer apercus / chemins
    SupabaseDB-->>AdminAPI: Documents + statuts
    SupabaseStorage-->>AdminAPI: Liens fichiers
    AdminAPI-->>Frontend: Liste enrichie
    Frontend-->>Admin: Consultation detaillee
